# Map preview components

Canonical doc: `docs/ui-rules/maps-components.md`.

## Prefer inline

**`GoogleMapsPreview`** for detail pages, route panels, location sections — no dialog required.

**`GoogleMapsPreviewButton`** only when space is tight (chat, table row, message footer).

## Embed URLs

Use `resolveGoogleMapsEmbed()` — never iframe a raw `/maps/dir/…` share link.

Optional env: `VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_EMBED_API_KEY` for official Embed API directions.

## Imports

```tsx
import {
  GoogleMapsPreview,
  GoogleMapsPreviewButton,
  GoogleMapsDialog,
  extractGoogleMapsUrls,
} from '@/components/maps/GoogleMapsDialog';
```

Icons: `MapIcon`, `ExternalLinkIcon` from `@/lib/icons`.

## Don't

- Custom iframe embeds without `googleMapsEmbed.ts`
- Nested card chrome around map preview
- Third-party map SDKs for standard route/place display
